2. WHAT YOU MAY DO
   a. Download the Mod from the official source and use it to play Minecraft, in singleplayer
      or multiplayer.
   b. Install the Mod on a Minecraft server you run, so long as players get their copy from the
      official source.
   c. Make and share videos, streams, screenshots, reviews and guides that show the Mod, and
      link to the official source.

3. WHAT YOU MAY NOT DO (without the author's written permission)
   a. Redistribute the Mod or any part of it: re-upload, mirror or host it on any other website,
